== Trivia ==
* The Habit was significantly nerfed from the previous game. In the original game, it would restore half of Isaac's item's required charge rather than just one room's worth of charge. This could essentially make Isaac unkillable if it was used in conjunction with {{i|Yum Heart}}, {{i|The Nail}}, or {{i|Book of Revelations}} and {{i|The Wafer}} for The {{s|Womb}} and beyond.
* This item is used in {{chal|When Life Gives You Lemons}}.

